   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OpEn 2022-2029 - The Ministry of Foreign Affairs&#x2019; Information and Engagement Fund (OpEn) 2022-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Information and Engagement Fund is to inform Danes on global issues of relevance to development cooperation and SDGs and/or engage citizens in making a difference for a more just, secure and sustainable world.</narrative>
